WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.767
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.000
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's great to hear.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:08.267
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:11.200
Former President Trump
spent last night at Trump Tower

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.200
after appearing
at his civil fraud trial.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.834
"It's good to be home,"
said Trump

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.667
as he walked into the courtroom.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.734
On the first day
of former President Trump's

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:22.834
civil fraud trial,
"The New York Post" reported

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.968
that a large takeout order
from McDonald's

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:27.434
was brought into the courthouse.

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:28.801
Wow.
I knew he was in trouble,

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:31.601
but I didn't know they were
seeking the death penalty.

00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:33.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.200
During the opening
of yesterday's trial,

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.133
former President Trump's lawyer
claimed that Trump's

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:40.434
Mar-a-Lago club would sell
for at least $1 billion.

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:43.734
Oh, I'm sure he could get that
just for what's in the shower.

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:46.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.167
After Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:49.834
filed a resolution
that would remove

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:51.601
Kevin McCarthy
from the speakership,

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:53.501
McCarthy tweeted, "Bring it on."

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:54.934
And Gaetz replied, "Just did."

00:00:54.934 --> 00:00:57.467
You know, a lot of people think

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:59.100
Joe Biden is too old
to govern,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.167
but it sounds like
these guys aren't old enough.

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:03.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:06.434
After Matt Gaetz announced the
motion to remove Kevin McCarthy,

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:08.200
McCarthy said Gaetz has

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.200
"personal things in his life
that he has challenges with,"

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.534
like figuring out how
to set his Venmo to private.

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:18.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:21.167
Hunter Biden was arraigned
in Delaware today

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.501
on federal gun charges.

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:25.601
We now go live
to the Fox News control room.

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.300
-[ Dramatic music plays ]
-[ All cheering ]

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.901
♪♪

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.667
You know, I'm happy for 'em.
They've had a --

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:35.367
They've had a rough time
recently.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.100
It's nice they get
a little light.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.300
Justice Clarence Thomas
yesterday

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.200
recused himself from
a Supreme Court decision

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.501
for the first time,

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.000
not because he had
a conflict of interest --

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.300
just because he had
a fishing trip planned.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.334
And it would have been rude
to cancel

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.234
'cause someone else paid for it.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:56.300
Oh, you'd cancel
on a wealthy friend?!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.501
A wealthy friend would fly you
private to a fishing trip

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:01.100
and you would cancel?

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.667
I think not!

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:05.868
This poor ma--

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:08.868
You judge this poor man?

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:10.300
A pauper?!

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:19.968
A pauper who can only fish
if a wealthy patron fly --

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:22.734
And you judge him.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:24.000
Shame!

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:27.801
Jury selection began today
in the trial against

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:30.834
disgraced FTX CEO
Sam Bankman-Fried,

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:32.901
which is surprising
'cause by the looks of him,

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.834
he already got
the electric chair.

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:38.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:42.200
"No, he's still ali--
It didn't take."

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.400
The fast-food chain Taco Bell
announced today

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.501
that it will add breakfast tacos
to its menu for the first time.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:51.033
Finally, some good news for
people who wake up still drunk.

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:52.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.367
[Slurring]
"Yeah, I'll get a taco."

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:59.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.901
Archaeologists in Spain believe

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:02.934
they have found
the oldest footwear

00:03:02.934 --> 00:03:04.267
ever discovered in Europe.

00:03:04.267 --> 00:03:07.634
So congratulations
to an American dad on vacation.

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:09.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:15.667
The first public beach
in Manhattan opened yesterday,

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:18.334
and I feel like it's gonna
be hard to tell who's sunbathing

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:20.234
and who just washed up there.

00:03:20.234 --> 00:03:23.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:26.901
"Hey, Johnny Three Fingers!
Enjoying the beach?

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:28.300
Johnny?"

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:35.834
A woman in Chicago
recently went skydiving

00:03:35.834 --> 00:03:38.067
at the age of 104.

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:40.701
And if you're wondering
what was up with her parachute,

00:03:40.701 --> 00:03:42.300
those were her breasts.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:52.300
We have a writer
named Mike Scollins

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.834
who wrote that joke, and --

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:55.934
Yeah, you've heard of him.
You heard of him.

00:03:55.934 --> 00:03:59.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:02.100
Bad guy. Good writer.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.734
I always say,
"You're a good writer.

00:04:03.734 --> 00:04:07.367
Why don't you write for good?"

00:04:07.367 --> 00:04:09.834
He's from Boston.
He's from Massachusetts and all.

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:11.934
He gives you a hard time.

00:04:11.934 --> 00:04:15.234
You tell him you don't
like his jokes, he's like...

00:04:15.234 --> 00:04:17.968
It's just better to let it go.

00:04:17.968 --> 00:04:20.534
He goes, "Do you get it?"
I go, "I get it."

00:04:20.534 --> 00:04:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.567
And, finally, last night's
Powerball jackpot --

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:30.133
I can't believe
Scollins got applause.

00:04:30.133 --> 00:04:31.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.501 --> 00:04:33.067
Nothing's worse --

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:36.000
[ Applause ]

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.200
Nothing worse
than trying to shame a guy

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.234
and find out he has fans!

00:04:41.234 --> 00:04:44.033
And, finally, last night's
Powerball jackpot

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:47.200
reached
an estimated $1.2 billion...

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.834
or as Trump's accountant
calls it, $35 billion.

00:04:50.834 --> 00:04:52.968
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

